      "statement": "The base DocumentLoader constructor creates a TTLCache(maxsize=100, ttl=cache_ttl) but does not itself cache load; CachedDocumentLoader caches with a (source bytes-or-string, vision_mode) key, and concrete loaders generally instead decorate load with cachetools.cachedmethod keyed on the source plus self.vision_mode so a cached non-vision result is never reused when vision mode is later enabled.",
